WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.020
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.860
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.860 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.740 --> 00:31.290
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.020
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.530 --> 00:58.300
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.300 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.010
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.010 --> 01:08.860
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.860 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.530 --> 01:25.180
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.850 --> 01:43.210
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.340 --> 01:47.000
=Episode 32=

01:47.680 --> 01:48.200
Mr. Yue

01:48.520 --> 01:49.200
and Miss Yue

01:49.720 --> 01:50.800
are chosen by the Hengdao Sect

01:50.800 --> 01:51.880
to kill Zhu Yu.

01:52.440 --> 01:52.720
Yes.

01:54.320 --> 01:56.280
I never appreciate
the Hengdao Sect's approach.

01:57.560 --> 01:58.600
But Qi made her choice.

02:00.120 --> 02:01.360
I'm going to stand by her.

02:02.600 --> 02:04.560
I truly admire

02:05.880 --> 02:07.360
your lofty spirit.

02:09.160 --> 02:09.639
Mr. Zuo.

02:10.199 --> 02:11.360
I bet you know that

02:11.880 --> 02:13.840
Zhu Yu has been consuming Qiyuan Orbs

02:13.840 --> 02:15.000
as if she's out of control.

02:15.880 --> 02:16.760
The Zhengwu Alliance

02:17.560 --> 02:18.880
is no match for her alone.

02:20.040 --> 02:21.000
You only stand a chance

02:21.600 --> 02:22.840
if you join hands with us.

02:24.040 --> 02:26.360
Is that a threat?

02:26.600 --> 02:27.920
I'm just stating the fact.

02:30.600 --> 02:32.680
What a pity that our reputation

02:35.079 --> 02:37.400
should end up disdained because of me.

02:38.320 --> 02:40.000
It matters more to save lives.

02:40.680 --> 02:41.520
Not many people know

02:41.920 --> 02:43.760
that the Hengdao Sect
controls the Qiyuan Sect.

02:44.480 --> 02:46.160
All you have to do is keep it a secret.

02:49.079 --> 02:50.120
We may fool others.

02:51.160 --> 02:52.840
But how do we fool ourselves?

02:53.720 --> 02:55.000
You can't.

02:55.520 --> 02:58.280
But it's all about
having a clear conscience.

02:59.720 --> 03:00.160
Leader.

03:00.680 --> 03:02.480
Death shall be my redemption.

03:02.840 --> 03:04.120
I'd die for the alliance.

03:05.440 --> 03:06.960
To protect our reputation, I can

03:07.840 --> 03:09.000
drop out of the alliance

03:09.240 --> 03:10.400
to assist them.

03:15.200 --> 03:15.560
Alright.

03:16.680 --> 03:17.520
You have a backbone.

03:18.320 --> 03:20.960
I'll make you the vanguard.

03:21.480 --> 03:22.040
Thank you.

03:22.840 --> 03:23.560
Mr. Yue.

03:25.520 --> 03:27.720
Please inform Ying Xuwei

03:28.920 --> 03:30.000
that I agree

03:33.560 --> 03:35.079
to work with the Hengdao Sect.

03:38.120 --> 03:38.880
Thank you.

03:40.200 --> 03:40.880
Leader.

03:43.120 --> 03:44.000
This is

03:45.000 --> 03:46.680
purely my decision.

03:48.440 --> 03:50.280
You're only pressured by me

03:50.560 --> 03:51.640
to carry out the task.

03:53.480 --> 03:54.000
Later,

03:56.120 --> 03:58.320
I'll make it clear to the people.

03:59.680 --> 04:02.040
We pledge loyalty to you, leader.

04:08.440 --> 04:08.880
Mr. Zuo.

04:10.120 --> 04:12.080
Once Rehai reaches Zangfeng Plains,

04:12.560 --> 04:13.480
Zhu Yu will come.

04:14.160 --> 04:14.640
Then

04:15.360 --> 04:16.839
you will handle the Yu Clan

04:17.440 --> 04:18.279
on Earth.

04:18.800 --> 04:20.079
Yujie Hub will handle the remnant

04:20.839 --> 04:21.760
on the Sea of Clear Skies.

04:23.600 --> 04:23.960
Alright.

04:24.800 --> 04:25.640
From now on,

04:26.160 --> 04:28.560
I will mobilize all our disciples

04:29.040 --> 04:30.000
against Zhu Yu.

04:41.680 --> 04:43.960
Zuo Guanren agreed to work with us?

04:46.280 --> 04:48.680
Yue Jinzhao made a deal with him.

04:51.600 --> 04:52.200
Xuwei.

04:53.560 --> 04:54.320
Do you regret it?

04:57.560 --> 04:58.920
I know I'm beyond redemption.

04:59.320 --> 05:02.120
All I can do is to save the Six Realms.

05:03.680 --> 05:04.800
Excuse me.

05:10.080 --> 05:11.040
Something is

05:11.720 --> 05:12.680
bothering me.

05:13.600 --> 05:14.240
When

05:14.920 --> 05:16.720
did Maiming contact you?

05:20.280 --> 05:21.200
Does it matter?

05:24.320 --> 05:25.360
It matters to me.

05:25.920 --> 05:27.200
Please kindly tell me.

05:30.440 --> 05:32.240
Back in the Luori Village,

05:33.000 --> 05:34.360
when you were asking Qi

05:34.360 --> 05:36.040
about Rehai,

05:37.159 --> 05:38.640
my people overheard you.

05:39.440 --> 05:42.120
Then, Xuwei visited the Luo family

05:43.640 --> 05:45.360
and spoke with Luo Maiming.

05:46.280 --> 05:47.640
Luo Maiming was a smart guy.

05:48.480 --> 05:51.640
He assessed the situation
and made a deal with us.

05:55.480 --> 05:56.360
This is...

05:57.800 --> 05:59.080
the key ring of Rehai.

06:02.240 --> 06:03.800
This key ring of Rehai

06:04.920 --> 06:07.120
is an important item against Zhu Yu.

06:08.800 --> 06:11.560
Next time we meet,
we'll discuss how to deal with Zhu Yu.

06:13.200 --> 06:16.040
I've agreed
to side with you against Zhu Yu.

06:16.720 --> 06:17.800
In exchange,

06:18.680 --> 06:22.360
will you show me
some sincerity, Mr. Ying?

06:25.720 --> 06:27.880
I wonder if the way
to remove the Bloodbinding

06:28.000 --> 06:28.880
can show my sincerity.

06:30.040 --> 06:31.560
We teamed up against Zhu Yu.

06:32.440 --> 06:33.280
He did it

06:33.880 --> 06:37.080
to learn how to remove
the Bloodbinding spell.

06:43.200 --> 06:43.640
Thank you.

06:44.800 --> 06:45.280
No problem.

06:59.640 --> 07:00.600
I always thought that

07:00.680 --> 07:02.120
Maiming had committed

07:03.400 --> 07:04.240
heinous crimes.

07:05.800 --> 07:06.720
I dare not even

07:08.960 --> 07:10.360
think about him these days.

07:14.320 --> 07:14.920
But now,

07:15.880 --> 07:17.200
I know that he's done his part

07:17.200 --> 07:18.400
to help take down Zhu Yu,

07:21.840 --> 07:22.080
I...

07:22.880 --> 07:24.480
don't know what to think.

07:31.880 --> 07:32.840
If you're confused,

07:34.440 --> 07:35.720
just follow your heart.

07:37.320 --> 07:37.840
Think about

07:39.080 --> 07:40.200
your initial aspiration.

07:41.600 --> 07:43.400
It may offer you the courage to face it.

07:47.400 --> 07:48.880
My initial aspiration?

08:05.240 --> 08:05.800
Xuwei.

08:06.520 --> 08:07.200
Have some tea.

08:12.880 --> 08:13.560
What's wrong?

08:14.880 --> 08:16.040
I talked too much?

08:20.400 --> 08:21.600
I know you're soft.

08:24.120 --> 08:27.360
If Zuo Guanren acts
according to the plan,

08:28.400 --> 08:30.000
we have a greater chance.

08:34.360 --> 08:36.080
There's only one final step.

08:37.039 --> 08:38.520
With Qi and Yue Jinzhao excluded,

08:38.960 --> 08:39.679
four people

08:40.679 --> 08:42.280
can approach the Yu Clan.

08:44.159 --> 08:45.400
If we keep our promise

08:45.800 --> 08:47.280
to Luo Maiming,

08:47.920 --> 08:50.720
Luo Zhaoyan and Xian Qing are excluded.

08:51.880 --> 08:53.040
As for those two...

08:55.520 --> 08:56.440
Ju Shifang

08:57.560 --> 08:58.360
and Shuo Xuan

08:58.920 --> 09:00.120
seem to have

09:00.320 --> 09:01.760
something going on.

09:04.400 --> 09:05.400
If anything goes wrong,

09:06.120 --> 09:07.320
we will do it ourselves.

09:08.480 --> 09:10.240
We must send the removal method

09:10.720 --> 09:13.520
of the Bloodbinding
to Mist Soul no matter what.

09:15.280 --> 09:16.680
For some people,

09:17.600 --> 09:18.920
the safety of one person

09:19.760 --> 09:21.200
matters more than anything.

09:22.400 --> 09:24.400
I didn't believe that.

09:31.720 --> 09:32.160
Xuwei.

09:33.920 --> 09:34.560
I'm thinking.

09:36.160 --> 09:37.680
Once the war is over,

09:38.760 --> 09:40.680
let's take Xiaoyuan

09:41.480 --> 09:44.040
to travel to the Mortal Realm.

09:50.680 --> 09:51.200
Alright.

10:39.120 --> 10:39.600
Xian Qing.

10:47.360 --> 10:49.480
Are you practicing
for the battle tomorrow?

10:50.400 --> 10:50.880
Yeah.

10:51.240 --> 10:52.920
Shall we exchange a few moves?

11:02.240 --> 11:02.680
Alright.

11:04.900 --> 11:08.910
♪I've never dreamed of the world♪

11:08.910 --> 11:11.950
♪The young man growing up carefree♪

11:11.950 --> 11:14.260
♪Toasts to the sun and moon♪

11:14.260 --> 11:16.930
♪He knows nothing about grief♪

11:16.930 --> 11:19.660
♪Shatter the moonlight with sword♪

11:19.660 --> 11:23.060
♪Drowned in wine, getting wasted♪

11:23.060 --> 11:27.660
♪The world is everchanging♪

11:27.660 --> 11:30.890
♪To guard the light in this world♪

11:30.890 --> 11:36.300
♪You're the light in my world,
my yearning becomes real♪

11:36.300 --> 11:38.290
♪The vicissitudes of life♪

11:38.290 --> 11:41.870
♪The world is in turbulence. So what♪

11:41.870 --> 11:47.950
♪You're fighting the world alongside me♪

11:48.580 --> 11:55.120
♪Write a legend with my sword,
you and me, side by side♪

11:55.120 --> 11:58.980
♪Fearless of love and hatred♪

11:58.980 --> 12:05.550
♪The destined path is full of turbulence,
yet it bothers me not♪

12:05.550 --> 12:10.610
♪I wander around, creating legends♪

12:16.570 --> 12:23.090
♪Write a legend with my sword,
you and me, side by side♪

12:23.090 --> 12:26.380
♪Fearless of love and hatred♪

12:27.400 --> 12:33.780
♪The destined path is full of turbulence,
yet it bothers me not♪

12:33.780 --> 12:38.930
♪I wander around, creating legends♪

12:49.800 --> 12:52.370
♪Carefree♪

12:52.370 --> 12:59.630
♪Even if the stars fade away,
I'll still be waiting♪

12:59.630 --> 13:02.930
♪Nostalgic about your gentle look♪

13:02.930 --> 13:08.340
♪Wander the world with a sword in hand
while all love and hatred♪

13:08.340 --> 13:12.850
♪Fade away through time♪

13:13.560 --> 13:14.320
Want a break?

13:17.840 --> 13:18.160
Alright.

13:27.440 --> 13:28.360
It seems that

13:29.240 --> 13:31.120
your mindset changed just now.

13:36.560 --> 13:37.600
You told me to keep

13:38.040 --> 13:39.040
my initial aspiration.

13:40.520 --> 13:41.400
I've been thinking

13:43.560 --> 13:44.960
and I finally figured it out

13:45.320 --> 13:46.280
during our practice.

13:49.760 --> 13:52.040
It's my aspiration and obligation
to shoulder my duty

13:52.920 --> 13:53.840
and protect

13:54.520 --> 13:55.360
the people I care about.

14:02.280 --> 14:03.600
You have a great ambition.

14:05.120 --> 14:06.080
I will stand by you.

14:08.920 --> 14:10.440
I can die for anyone,

14:13.920 --> 14:15.280
but I only live for one person.

14:31.040 --> 14:31.560
Ms. Ge.

14:31.840 --> 14:32.920
I've learned a lot

14:32.920 --> 14:34.480
about gadgets from you these days.

14:34.800 --> 14:35.320
Thanks.

14:35.800 --> 14:36.320
No problem.

14:37.440 --> 14:37.720
Right.

14:39.400 --> 14:41.240
Thanks to your

14:41.360 --> 14:42.240
instructions,

14:42.520 --> 14:44.000
I've managed to improve it.

14:45.040 --> 14:45.560
Shifang.

14:46.760 --> 14:47.320
Coming.

14:48.840 --> 14:49.360
Ms. Ge.

14:49.640 --> 14:50.450
Jinzhao is calling me.

14:50.680 --> 14:51.480
See you.

14:53.400 --> 14:53.800
Go ahead.

15:02.600 --> 15:03.200
Goodbye.

15:04.680 --> 15:06.040
And farewell.

15:46.240 --> 15:46.760
Mr. Zuo.

15:47.560 --> 15:48.480
How did it go?

15:50.000 --> 15:51.800
Chen Qianjun and our people were spotted

15:52.200 --> 15:53.960
by the demons at the Zangfeng Plains

15:55.440 --> 15:56.600
and suffered a huge loss.

15:57.920 --> 15:59.200
The battle hasn't started

15:59.360 --> 16:01.240
and we're already suffering huge losses?

16:02.120 --> 16:02.640
Mr. Zuo.

16:03.120 --> 16:04.800
Please do me a favor.

16:06.880 --> 16:08.240
The gadgets of Yujie Hub

16:08.760 --> 16:10.440
can attack the physical form of Kun.

16:11.280 --> 16:12.400
But it's a mythical beast.

16:13.040 --> 16:14.920
The attack has to
land on the weakest spot

16:14.920 --> 16:15.800
to work.

16:16.600 --> 16:18.240
You've observed Zhu Yu for years

16:18.880 --> 16:19.840
and came up with

16:19.840 --> 16:21.200
three possible spots

16:21.720 --> 16:22.680
without certainty.

16:23.800 --> 16:24.680
The stored energy

16:25.040 --> 16:27.280
allows the Yujie Hub
to launch three attacks.

16:29.360 --> 16:31.840
The Hengdao Sect needs
the Dragon Crystals in Wuyan Village.

16:32.640 --> 16:34.200
The more crystals we dig out,

16:34.800 --> 16:35.960
the more likely we can win.

16:36.880 --> 16:39.480
I thought the Hengdao Sect
could see the future

16:39.560 --> 16:41.040
and had an awe-inspiring power.

16:41.720 --> 16:42.560
In the end,

16:42.600 --> 16:44.080
they need us to dig rocks for them.

16:44.600 --> 16:45.080
Lingyun.

16:46.200 --> 16:47.360
(See the future?)

16:48.000 --> 16:50.280
We're not doing this for
the Hengdao Sect or the Yujie Hub.

16:52.240 --> 16:53.800
It's for the people.

16:55.000 --> 16:55.480
That's right.

16:56.200 --> 16:58.640
To fight for the people
is to fight for ourselves.

17:03.360 --> 17:06.119
Miss Yue, you're truly wise.

17:09.240 --> 17:09.720
Lingyun.

17:10.560 --> 17:11.119
Work on it.

17:12.880 --> 17:13.300
Understood.

17:16.520 --> 17:17.160
Where is Shifang?

17:18.560 --> 17:21.119
He went to check on the gadgets
at the Jiqiao Hall.

17:24.359 --> 17:26.280
It's his birthday.

17:28.079 --> 17:28.600
Never mind.

17:30.240 --> 17:32.400
Get to business.

18:44.400 --> 18:45.040
Come in.

18:49.560 --> 18:50.680
Senior Xian Qing?

19:12.160 --> 19:14.640
(Ju Shifang.)

19:27.920 --> 19:30.200
(I've entrusted the way
to undermine Zhu Yu)

19:30.280 --> 19:31.680
(to someone trustworthy.)

19:32.320 --> 19:33.080
(Come at 13:15)

19:33.560 --> 19:35.000
(to the river shore of Jing'an)

19:35.440 --> 19:37.200
(if you're interested.)

19:49.390 --> 19:50.770
(Ming Xiu)

20:21.720 --> 20:22.560
Hello?

20:33.160 --> 20:33.960
Hello?

20:43.720 --> 20:44.600
Cang Feng.

20:45.400 --> 20:46.560
You delivered the letter?

20:49.680 --> 20:50.720
Then Miss Ming...

20:51.280 --> 20:53.240
I asked her to meet me tomorrow.

20:56.040 --> 20:56.920
(Ju Shifang)
The note said

20:57.200 --> 20:59.280
if I was ready to sacrifice myself,

20:59.560 --> 21:01.440
you could help us undermine Kun's power.

21:04.320 --> 21:05.010
It's from my master.

21:10.000 --> 21:11.400
(The bottle contains Yue Qi's blood.)

21:12.520 --> 21:15.040
(Yue Qi and Zhu Yu are bonded by blood.)

21:15.360 --> 21:18.080
(Her blood is the key
to removing the Bloodbinding.)

21:19.000 --> 21:20.920
(Smudge the blood on Shuo Xuan)

21:21.080 --> 21:22.320
(and injure her)

21:23.520 --> 21:26.560
(so that she enters the Core
of the Demon Realm for treatment.)

21:27.520 --> 21:28.480
(Yue Qi's blood)

21:28.640 --> 21:30.080
(and the power of Rehai)

21:30.400 --> 21:32.160
(will remove the Bloodbinding)

21:32.640 --> 21:34.840
(between Zhu Yu and Mist Soul.)

21:36.480 --> 21:40.360
(Zhu Yu's Vitality Energy
will drop massively)

21:41.400 --> 21:44.360
(and that's
your best chance to kill her.)

21:44.480 --> 21:46.920
M-Miss Shuo Xuan?

21:47.840 --> 21:49.840
Does it have to be her?

21:50.800 --> 21:51.160
Yes.

21:56.560 --> 21:57.080
Shuo...

22:01.740 --> 22:02.510
You're hesitating.

22:03.600 --> 22:04.600
If you're scared,

22:05.280 --> 22:05.880
forget it.

22:15.760 --> 22:17.760
So it's Shifang's birthday.

22:18.160 --> 22:19.800
He never mentioned it.

22:21.720 --> 22:22.600
Shifang

22:23.000 --> 22:24.840
will be one year older tomorrow.

22:26.360 --> 22:27.400
Mr. Zuo and Mr. Ying

22:27.520 --> 22:29.280
were discussing the battle earlier.

22:29.520 --> 22:30.880
It sounded like Mr. Zuo wanted to

22:31.080 --> 22:32.240
celebrate Shifang's birthday.

22:32.800 --> 22:34.800
But he may not have time for it.

22:39.120 --> 22:40.760
When we toured around Jing'an at night,

22:40.840 --> 22:42.240
I think he mentioned that

22:42.480 --> 22:43.680
he would love to celebrate

22:43.920 --> 22:46.040
his birthday just like Ming Xiu did.

22:50.360 --> 22:51.760
What do you think?

22:53.480 --> 22:54.720
Jing'an has become desolate.

22:55.320 --> 22:56.240
A night tour

22:56.520 --> 22:57.600
may only upset him.

22:58.840 --> 23:00.000
Any other ideas?

23:05.880 --> 23:06.440
How about this?

23:06.440 --> 23:07.400
Let's get some things

23:07.640 --> 23:09.360
and decorate this place before he

23:09.680 --> 23:10.200
comes back.

23:11.640 --> 23:12.040
Alright.

23:12.400 --> 23:14.560
And we should make a noodle with an egg.

23:19.000 --> 23:19.920
Miss Shuo Xuan.

23:38.240 --> 23:38.800
I got this.

23:39.320 --> 23:40.000
Give it to me.

23:47.760 --> 23:48.640
It contains

23:49.000 --> 23:50.280
Little Yue's blood?

23:50.960 --> 23:51.240
Yes.

23:54.720 --> 23:56.640
Jinzhao and Xian Qing
told us to be careful.

23:57.720 --> 23:58.480
The Hengdao Sect

23:58.960 --> 24:00.560
may send the removal method

24:00.960 --> 24:02.880
to Mist Soul regardless of our safety.

24:04.680 --> 24:06.640
But I guess they don't know

24:07.360 --> 24:08.560
that it should be you.

24:11.800 --> 24:13.920
Jinzhao and Little Yue
are the keys to taking down Zhu Yu.

24:14.920 --> 24:15.520
And

24:16.000 --> 24:17.400
Luo Maiming cares about Zhaoyan.

24:17.880 --> 24:18.400
So...

24:18.680 --> 24:20.760
only Xian Qing, Miss Ming, and I

24:20.880 --> 24:22.160
got the letter, right?

24:23.080 --> 24:23.760
Not the wolf demon.

24:26.520 --> 24:26.880
Then...

24:27.560 --> 24:28.760
So if I make it,

24:29.120 --> 24:31.080
Miss Ming won't take the risk, right?

24:32.080 --> 24:32.880
I can't guarantee that.

25:09.620 --> 25:14.030
(Jiqiao Hall)

25:25.190 --> 25:29.810
(Jiqiao Hall)

25:43.920 --> 25:45.600
I just tried my new...

25:46.000 --> 25:47.880
gadget.

25:52.010 --> 25:53.430
(Stay Focused and collected)

25:53.600 --> 25:54.320
Nobody's here?

25:59.320 --> 25:59.920
That's better.

26:03.120 --> 26:03.600
That's better.

26:09.600 --> 26:10.240
That's better.

26:13.640 --> 26:14.200
That's better.

26:20.000 --> 26:20.480
Shifang.

26:23.560 --> 26:24.280
Yang.

26:27.160 --> 26:27.800
In trouble again?

26:29.560 --> 26:30.520
N-No.

26:32.400 --> 26:33.360
Our leader wants to see you.

26:48.160 --> 26:48.800
What's wrong?

26:49.000 --> 26:49.520
Come on in.

27:26.040 --> 27:26.400
Shifang.

27:28.320 --> 27:28.680
Go ahead.

27:41.720 --> 27:43.600
It's your 20th birthday.

27:44.880 --> 27:47.040
I'm supposed to hold a ceremony for you.

27:48.320 --> 27:51.000
But it's a critical time
with the battle pending.

27:53.880 --> 27:54.960
So I downsized it.

27:57.600 --> 27:58.600
From now on,

27:59.800 --> 28:01.840
you'll be a real adult.

28:05.800 --> 28:06.920
I wish you longevity

28:07.840 --> 28:09.200
and happiness.

28:31.960 --> 28:32.320
Get up.

28:41.960 --> 28:42.840
You've grown up.

28:47.440 --> 28:47.920
Shifang.

28:48.280 --> 28:48.880
Shifang.

28:49.320 --> 28:50.520
Happy birthday.

28:50.880 --> 28:52.560
Shifang, happy birthday.

28:53.920 --> 28:54.440
Mr. Zuo.

29:06.600 --> 29:08.800
I still have many things to do.

29:09.160 --> 29:10.960
Enjoy the night.

29:12.640 --> 29:13.120
Alright.

29:17.800 --> 29:19.720
Shifang, happy birthday.

29:20.200 --> 29:21.200
Let's drink tomorrow.

29:23.760 --> 29:24.840
Come on.

29:25.040 --> 29:25.680
Come on.

29:30.000 --> 29:30.280
Sit.

29:31.080 --> 29:32.680
Shifang, happy birthday.

29:32.800 --> 29:33.200
Look.

29:36.320 --> 29:37.480
Ming Xiu

29:37.640 --> 29:39.320
made the noodles for you.

29:39.640 --> 29:40.640
Dig in.

29:48.360 --> 29:49.000
Ming Xiu.

29:50.600 --> 29:52.280
It's your birthday.

29:54.280 --> 29:55.200
Happy birthday.

29:56.910 --> 29:58.110
(So if I make it,)

29:58.430 --> 30:00.350
(Miss Ming won't take the risk, right?)

30:04.400 --> 30:05.880
Shifang, happy birthday.

30:06.320 --> 30:07.000
Rest assured,

30:07.200 --> 30:08.680
we'll be celebrating

30:08.840 --> 30:10.440
all your birthdays with you

30:10.560 --> 30:12.200
every year from now on.

30:13.800 --> 30:14.120
Yeah.

30:15.000 --> 30:15.680
The birthday boy

30:15.680 --> 30:16.560
has to make a wish.

30:16.800 --> 30:17.200
Come on.

30:17.880 --> 30:18.520
Make a wish.

30:18.600 --> 30:19.200
Make a wish.

30:19.320 --> 30:19.680
Hurry.

30:53.280 --> 30:55.440
My wish is to become

30:55.440 --> 30:57.680
a great gadget technician like my mom

30:58.680 --> 30:59.400
and

31:00.880 --> 31:02.880
to gather for birthdays

31:03.160 --> 31:05.960
like we're doing right now.

31:14.920 --> 31:15.520
What's wrong?

31:15.800 --> 31:16.480
Make a wish.

31:48.640 --> 31:49.160
Shifang.

31:50.040 --> 31:50.520
What's wrong?

31:52.120 --> 31:52.720
What's wrong?

32:02.080 --> 32:02.840
Nothing.

32:04.040 --> 32:04.480
I...

32:06.800 --> 32:08.800
I haven't celebrated my birthday

32:09.160 --> 32:11.280
with such a big crowd for many years.

32:12.720 --> 32:15.320
Wen Yang used to keep me company.

32:16.680 --> 32:18.120
And our leader, sometimes.

32:19.080 --> 32:20.520
But they've been very busy.

32:22.200 --> 32:24.480
I celebrated my birthday alone
most of the years.

32:30.080 --> 32:31.480
But it's alright now.

32:32.240 --> 32:33.080
I have you.

32:34.280 --> 32:35.480
It's the first time

32:35.800 --> 32:37.680
I'm celebrating my birthday
with so many friends.

32:39.200 --> 32:40.360
I think my life

32:41.560 --> 32:42.720
is worth it.

32:43.640 --> 32:44.000
Yeah.

32:44.840 --> 32:45.480
Come on.

32:45.880 --> 32:46.400
Shifang.

32:47.000 --> 32:48.280
We'll celebrate your birthday

32:49.480 --> 32:51.640
with you every year from now on.

32:54.560 --> 32:55.080
Be good.

32:56.640 --> 32:57.040
Dig in.

32:57.480 --> 32:58.160
Try it.

33:04.640 --> 33:05.120
Okay.

33:05.840 --> 33:06.640
Then...

33:07.920 --> 33:08.640
Then...

33:09.360 --> 33:10.440
it's a deal.

33:10.800 --> 33:11.600
You'll celebrate

33:13.360 --> 33:15.320
my birthday every year.

33:17.200 --> 33:18.160
This day every year.

33:21.600 --> 33:22.960
I won't change at all.

33:24.760 --> 33:25.320
No problem.

33:27.000 --> 33:29.200
You want a demon spell

33:29.560 --> 33:30.600
to stay young forever.

33:34.040 --> 33:35.520
It's Shifang's birthday.

33:36.360 --> 33:37.560
We need alcohol.

33:39.680 --> 33:40.480
Let's get wasted.

33:41.360 --> 33:41.800
Alright.

33:52.200 --> 33:52.520
Come on.

34:20.239 --> 34:21.360
- Shifang.
- Shifang.

34:21.639 --> 34:25.000
- Happy birthday.
- Happy birthday.

34:59.200 --> 35:00.920
I must send the removal method

35:01.480 --> 35:03.080
to the Mist Soul inside Kun.

35:04.000 --> 35:06.160
That's the only way
for Jinzhao and the others

35:07.080 --> 35:08.800
to stop the madness of Zhu Yu.

35:09.880 --> 35:10.840
I can do this.

35:11.760 --> 35:12.720
I have to.

35:13.640 --> 35:14.680
I have to.

35:16.600 --> 35:18.200
Mr. Gu died for me at the headquarters

35:19.040 --> 35:20.360
of the Qiyuan Sect.

35:21.720 --> 35:22.360
It's my turn

35:23.360 --> 35:24.600
to protect you.

35:25.680 --> 35:27.120
It's my turn to protect you.

35:44.080 --> 35:44.760
Mother,

35:46.800 --> 35:48.640
you'll be watching me from heaven.

35:49.920 --> 35:50.720
Right?

36:01.320 --> 36:02.440
I'm crying?

36:03.640 --> 36:04.360
So embarrassing.

36:16.040 --> 36:16.440
Dou Bao.

36:25.000 --> 36:25.360
Let's go.

36:43.840 --> 36:44.560
Enemy approaching.

36:46.240 --> 36:46.680
Wait.

36:47.240 --> 36:48.160
Hasn't he been to

36:48.160 --> 36:49.800
the Sea of Clear Skies
with our young lord?

36:50.520 --> 36:51.520
It's weird.

36:52.400 --> 36:54.000
Why did he come here alone?

36:54.280 --> 36:55.600
General said that

36:55.960 --> 36:57.120
the young lord had betrayed us.

36:57.360 --> 36:59.040
Her friends are our enemies.

36:59.320 --> 37:00.200
Get him. Go.

37:00.200 --> 37:01.080
Go.

37:02.120 --> 37:02.560
Stop!

37:05.360 --> 37:05.880
Get him.

37:06.200 --> 37:07.040
Understood.

37:34.760 --> 37:35.400
Ju Shifang.

37:36.400 --> 37:37.680
You shouldn't be here.

37:38.520 --> 37:39.680
We're enemies, not friends.

37:40.280 --> 37:41.000
I won't show mercy

37:41.680 --> 37:42.880
on the battlefield.

37:44.200 --> 37:45.000
I want to...

37:45.400 --> 37:46.800
I want to see Miss Shuo Xuan.

37:47.920 --> 37:49.720
You think you can just
ask to see our lord?

37:50.480 --> 37:51.760
Who do you think you are?

37:52.640 --> 37:53.230
Take him away.

37:55.400 --> 37:56.120
Let go.

38:20.490 --> 38:23.380
♪If I trek
through the long river of memory♪

38:24.420 --> 38:27.040
♪What will I pick up♪

38:27.980 --> 38:32.690
♪Is it joy from the past years
or piercing pain♪

38:34.980 --> 38:37.730
♪What did I hear♪

38:38.570 --> 38:42.380
♪Laughter from the Milky Way♪

38:42.380 --> 38:46.960
♪My heartbeat remembers it. Who are you♪

38:49.320 --> 38:52.980
♪I can't grasp the fleeting joy♪

38:52.980 --> 38:56.110
♪I can't have you by my side♪

38:56.110 --> 38:59.540
♪I have to come to terms
with my regrets♪

38:59.600 --> 39:03.410
♪Why do my memories stir up emotions♪

39:06.790 --> 39:10.350
♪I look for you, and I approach you♪

39:10.350 --> 39:14.130
♪Sweeping over like a tide♪

39:14.130 --> 39:17.780
♪I stole the answer
to the riddle from destiny♪

39:17.780 --> 39:21.300
♪Can it exchange for your stay♪

39:21.300 --> 39:25.040
♪I had you in my grasp, but I lost you♪

39:25.040 --> 39:28.390
♪Thus reunion took on a new meaning♪

39:31.430 --> 39:33.870
♪That's a riddle set up
in the past life♪

39:34.890 --> 39:37.880
♪Where are you who was by my side♪

39:42.000 --> 39:42.740
♪You left♪

39:42.740 --> 39:44.660
♪Even the silence speaks of pain♪

39:44.660 --> 39:46.850
♪I pass through the crowd
after you left♪

39:46.850 --> 39:48.370
♪Reach the end of time♪

39:48.370 --> 39:50.310
♪The only sentiment left there♪

39:50.310 --> 39:51.760
♪Is like your last smile♪

39:51.760 --> 39:53.390
♪Lighting up my night sky♪

39:53.390 --> 39:55.580
♪Spreading my arms, I escaped gravity♪

39:56.520 --> 39:59.890
♪It's time to let go♪

40:00.290 --> 40:03.280
♪I pretend to be able to let go♪

40:03.280 --> 40:06.480
♪The story needs some twist and turns♪

40:07.140 --> 40:10.450
♪We keep looking back
because we hate to part♪

40:10.450 --> 40:13.960
♪I look for you, and I approach you♪

40:13.960 --> 40:17.720
♪Sweeping over like a tide♪

40:17.720 --> 40:21.180
♪I stole the answer
to the riddle from destiny♪

40:21.180 --> 40:24.860
♪Can it exchange for your stay♪

40:24.860 --> 40:28.570
♪I had you in my grasp, but I lost you♪

40:28.570 --> 40:33.930
♪Thus reunion took on a new meaning♪

40:35.060 --> 40:37.590
♪That's a riddle set up
in the past life♪

40:38.660 --> 40:43.820
♪Where are you who was by my side♪

40:43.820 --> 40:47.590
♪I want to say something
but the memories are fading away♪

40:47.590 --> 40:51.250
♪My broken heart
is drowning in loneliness♪

40:51.250 --> 40:57.230
♪Will we meet again♪

40:58.350 --> 41:01.810
♪Where am I going to stop
among the crowd♪

41:01.810 --> 41:05.210
♪I know your look,
gentle and determined♪

41:05.210 --> 41:12.250
♪You will look at me and me only♪

41:15.850 --> 41:19.440
♪I met you, and I left you♪

41:19.440 --> 41:23.100
♪We pass by each other without a word♪

41:23.100 --> 41:26.710
♪My longing is embedded in every breath♪

41:26.710 --> 41:30.410
♪This is how much I love you♪

41:30.410 --> 41:34.140
♪I miss you, and I forgot about you♪

41:34.140 --> 41:38.990
♪How do I pacify
the conflicting feelings♪

41:41.420 --> 41:43.790
♪You approach me
with such determination♪

41:45.940 --> 41:49.390
♪I hear you calling my name♪
